  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 41 Bridge Road.pdf\n\nClause 9.41.1 - heritage (heritage): The precinct contains one heritage ite m being t he former factory at 2 -6 Bridge Road.\n\nClause 9.41.1 - parking (development_control): Private parking provision in the precinct is generally good and most sites have off -street parking provided either at grade or at basement level and accessed from Bridge Road.\n\nClause 9.41.1 - setback (development_control): There is a consistent nil setback on the western side of Bridge Road.\n\nClause 9.41.2 - other (heritage): To protect the identified Heritage Items  within  the precinct.\n\nClause 9.41.2 - other (development_control): To ensure that buildings provide strong definition to the street  through retention of the existing zero building line setbacks.\n\nClause 9.41.2 - parking (development_control): To facilitate efficient parking, loading and access for vehicles that minimises impact to streetscape appearance, commercial viability and vitality and pedestrian safety and amenity.\n\n",
